  "markdown": "top of page\n\nSkip to Main Content\n\n## Olga Carroll   Sourcing Manager\n\n![olga portrait 5.jpg](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_cf2e2bc0898347a6bd283fb2ccf58264~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_205,h_301,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/olga%20portrait%205.jpg)\n\nI have extensive experience in international travel, budgeting, and management of groups of various industries. I thoroughly enjoy working with people of many national personalities while speaking three foreign languages.\n\nMy passion is to help my clients reach their expectations through increased value. I love learning and growing professionally whether it is homeschooling my children or embarking on a new journey in business.\n\nI live in Dallas, TX with my husband and two daughters after moving across the ocean 20 years ago. I love traveling through historical sites all over the world, hiking, playing piano, and ice-skating.\n\n[![REACH logo](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_b6659293240c40db888d813137f151bc~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_240,h_100,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Reach%20Logo%20jpg.jpg)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/)\n\nbottom of page",
